// single-quoted JS string literal in an inline script and carries
// buyer-supplied values (email, telephone, address, product names). Without
// JSON_HEX_APOS a buyer's apostrophe closes the literal, and without
// JSON_HEX_TAG a buyer who types a script end tag terminates the whole block
// early — script injection on the checkout, and a second way to hijack the
// tag search that HyvaCsp uses to place the nonce.
//
// What this is NOT is a JSON payload anything reads. The value below is the
